        {
          "id": "63d2019c-de34-411c-9de2-51e912757f89",
          "name": "Create company",
          "request": {
            "name": "Create company",
            "description": {
              "content": "Create a new company. Creates an offline company that can later be onboarded.\n\n**Notes:**\n- Name is the only required field.\n- Non-required fields and their defaults:\n  - `description`: defaults to empty string\n  - `city`: defaults to empty string\n  - `sector`: defaults to \"Other\" if not provided or invalid\n  - `fiscal_year_end`: defaults to \"12/31\"\n  - `website`: defaults to empty string\n\nYou may update the company later using the `Update Company` endpoint. Reference this endpoint to understand what fields can be modified.\n\n**Permissions:**\n- User must be authenticated via OAuth.\n- User must have ADMIN or EDITOR role.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "companies",
                ""
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": []
            },
