        {
          "id": "1806cefc-1a4a-4ee6-bb56-374489b08111",
          "name": "Update company",
          "request": {
            "name": "Update company",
            "description": {
              "content": "Partially update company fields. Different fields are editable based on company onboarding status.\n\n**Online companies** (already onboarded):\nOnly the following fields can be updated:\n1. `firm_sector` (the name of the Firm Sector for this company)\n2. `investment_lead_id` (the user ID of the investment lead)\n\n**Offline or Pending companies** (not onboarded; Pending means there's an active invite):\nThe following fields can be updated:\n1. `firm_sector`\n2. `investment_lead_id`\n3. `city` (the city where the company is based)\n4. `description` (a description of the company)\n5. `fiscal_year_end` (formatted as 'MM/DD')\n6. `name` (the company name)\n7. `sector` (the company's standard sector from the supported list)\n8. `website` (the company's website)\n\n**Permissions:**\n- User must be authenticated via OAuth.\n- User must have access to the companies.\n- User must have ADMIN or EDITOR role.",
              "type": "text/plain"
            },
            "url": {
              "path": [
                "companies",
                ":company_id",
                ""
              ],
              "host": [
                "{{baseUrl}}"
              ],
              "query": [],
              "variable": [
                {
                  "disabled": false,
                  "type": "any",
                  "value": "<string>",
                  "key": "company_id",
                  "description": "(Required) "
                }
              ]
