                  "key": "file",
                  "value": "<binary>",
                  "description": "(Required) The logo file to upload. Must be sent as part of a multipart/form-data POST request. File size limit: 5 MB maximum. Accepted file types: .jpg, .jpeg, .png, .gif, .webp"
                }
              ]
